{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02489",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 6.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.61,
      "end_seconds": 11.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.11,
      "end_seconds": 20.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "Doctor, um, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.08,
      "end_seconds": 27.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a fever for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.41,
      "end_seconds": 34.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.16,
      "end_seconds": 38.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "I'd say three days, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 43.56,
      "end_seconds": 46.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "It was closer to five days, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.56,
      "end_seconds": 53.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to five days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.97,
      "end_seconds": 59.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Yeah, roughly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.76,
      "end_seconds": 63.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.14,
      "end_seconds": 66.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Mild, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.99,
      "end_seconds": 69.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.45,
      "end_seconds": 77.97,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Uh, it's, um... not exactly... well, hard to explain, I mean—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.46,
      "end_seconds": 86.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "Let me put it another way: how many times in a typical day or week?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.37,
      "end_seconds": 89.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "It happens all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.74,
      "end_seconds": 94.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Alright, is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.16,
      "end_seconds": 100.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Right, when it starts I tend to get night sweats as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.53,
      "end_seconds": 109.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "Mm, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 109.55,
      "end_seconds": 114.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.07,
      "end_seconds": 122.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "I was getting to that! The night sweats? That's been for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.02,
      "end_seconds": 127.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.23,
      "end_seconds": 130.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 131.39,
      "end_seconds": 134.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Mm, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.74,
      "end_seconds": 140.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Have you noticed weight loss, chest pain or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.97,
      "end_seconds": 155.04,
      "duration_seconds": 14.07,
      "text": "Um, no, no weight loss, no chest pain, no cough. I did have small painful spots on my fingers at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.25,
      "end_seconds": 162.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.24,
      "end_seconds": 168.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Uh, that's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.25,
      "end_seconds": 173.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Okay, how are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.74,
      "end_seconds": 177.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.73,
      "end_seconds": 183.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.07,
      "end_seconds": 198.84,
      "duration_seconds": 13.77,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. No, I've never smoked in my life. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.11,
      "end_seconds": 203.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.35,
      "end_seconds": 207.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.78,
      "end_seconds": 213.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.95,
      "end_seconds": 217.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.66,
      "end_seconds": 223.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.17,
      "end_seconds": 227.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "My cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.86,
      "end_seconds": 243.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.96,
      "end_seconds": 248.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Erm, I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.86,
      "end_seconds": 258.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.41,
      "end_seconds": 261.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.88,
      "end_seconds": 276.76,
      "duration_seconds": 12.88,
      "text": "For the anxiety, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. Alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 278.83,
      "end_seconds": 287.32,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the alendronate was 140 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.39,
      "end_seconds": 292.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.85,
      "end_seconds": 302.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "No, I left it at home. I'm on Seretide inhaler, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.78,
      "end_seconds": 307.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.09,
      "end_seconds": 310.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Yes, eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.76,
      "end_seconds": 313.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.62,
      "end_seconds": 327.89,
      "duration_seconds": 12.27,
      "text": "Um, I have anxiety, for five years. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I've had thin bones, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.41,
      "end_seconds": 330.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.46,
      "end_seconds": 334.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I've had asthma for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.45,
      "end_seconds": 343.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "Right, so eczema and anxiety are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 345.7,
      "end_seconds": 362.44,
      "duration_seconds": 16.74,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Weight 68 kilos, SpO2 97 percent on room air. Temp 39.3 degrees, blood pressure 121 over 66, height 174 centimetres, BMI works out to 22.5, pulse is 102 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.54,
      "end_seconds": 365.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.73,
      "end_seconds": 370.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.15,
      "end_seconds": 374.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.38,
      "end_seconds": 396.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.25,
      "text": "There is a new murmur, small splinter lines under the nails and a tender spot on the finger pad."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.24,
      "end_seconds": 417.58,
      "duration_seconds": 15.34,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Putting it all together, it's hard to say. Possible infective endocarditis is one possibility and a viral illness another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 418.95,
      "end_seconds": 421.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 422.96,
      "end_seconds": 431.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with possible infective endocarditis do well once it's treated properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 446.51,
      "end_seconds": 474.39,
      "duration_seconds": 27.88,
      "text": "We should do blood cultures for possible endocarditis. I'll request blood tests, it'll help with prolonged fever. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I think an echocardiogram makes sense here, for new murmur. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. You need admission today for blood cultures and a heart scan. I'll also refer you to the cardiology team."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 475.15,
      "end_seconds": 483.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 485.94,
      "end_seconds": 490.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Actually, okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 490.96,
      "end_seconds": 496.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 497.2,
      "end_seconds": 501.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Um, okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 502.95,
      "end_seconds": 508.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Please come and see me straight away. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 509.71,
      "end_seconds": 511.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}